{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方首段的大号白字及红色强调词“不再藏着喜欢”“我不再为它道歉”，随后容易被第二块黄色强调词“连害臊都顾不上了”“没什么不好”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人意识到自己喜欢、在乎对方，决定不再隐藏这份感情。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"坦然、不再羞愧、欢喜；隐约的心痛和不安不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"对方有时也需要他、即使不需要他仍愿意陪伴的具体关系处境；以及担心以后不能继续亲近，欢喜因此变成心痛的情绪转折。中间四行小字里的过去与现在的对照也不容易抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方红色强调段、黄色强调段、下方灰白色段都有较大的字号。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要拼起来才懂：上方讲不再隐藏喜欢，中间讲不再羞愧，下方才交代欢喜背后的心痛。\",\n    \"单块太长、一块里有好几层意思，尤其上方首段同时包含双方需要、愿意陪伴和坦然承认感情。\",\n    \"小字连续堆叠、要在多条之间挑，中间四行辅助文字不容易快速提取。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0aacb32f-c1e2-4cfd-80c9-5b400cbff441", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012354265349Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:24:26.791417+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "88c5949838efa08f24e79ff53617fd458df2b6936fccf2234a1a5366cfc2b08a", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T012354265349Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "492fb4d13821fce60b8873af2cd73be542adab09911bff98fe3f224c1465fe5c"}}}
